]prompts/202611/bead_k_preview.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-1sy[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-1sy/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]K on a bead opens a bead card[/bold #D7AFFF]                                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]peek[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]peek: recognize bare and @bead: IDs at the cursor, route them through a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]warm app-level bead store directory, splice the bead step into the K [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]chain with a byte-for-byte resume of the word lookup for non-beads, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ship the BeadPreviewModal core (title, chips, description, property [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]grid, copy/plan actions, loading state).[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Related beads, navigation, and full detail[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]relations[dim] · [dim][/dim]after peek[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]relations: add lineage, a numbered phase/children list with a progress [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]meter, and dependencies to the card, in-card drill-down (1-9, p, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]backspace, r), Enter and Ctrl+] opening the full bead detail in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pager, help/docs updates, and PNG goldens.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Status-tinted bead mentions in the prompt[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mentions[dim] · [dim][/dim]after peek, relations[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mentions: underline resolved bead IDs in prompt text using a memory-only[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]overlay fed by an app-level, fingerprint-revalidated mention 